<title>BARBADOS: CRICKET-RED STRIPE CUP SCORES.</title>
<headline>CRICKET-RED STRIPE CUP SCORES.</headline>
<dateline>BRIDGETOWN 1997-05-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Scores on the third day of</p>
<p>four-day Red Stripe Cup cricket matches played on Sunday:</p>
<p>In Charlestown, Nevis: Guyana 257 and 160-4 (Z.Haniff 71,</p>
<p>A.Haniff 62). Leewards Islands 221 (R.Powell 51).</p>
<p>In Kingston: Trinidad and Tobago 160 and 245 (D.Williams</p>
<p>55). Jamaica 226 and 99-4 (R.Samuels 55).</p>
